{"id":"left-to-right","label":"Left to Right Tree","description":"Curved edges from a root on the left, branch labels above their node and leaf labels on the right; click a node to collapse it.","howTo":["Bind `series[0].data` to a list holding ONE root object: `[{name, children: [{name, children: [...]}]}]`. A script transform that nests a flat parent/child query works well.","Branch labels sit above their node (`series[0].label`), leaf labels to the right (`series[0].leaves.label`), so no edge runs through the text. Leave room: `left` must fit the root label and `right` the longest leaf label.","`initialTreeDepth: -1` opens every level; set it to 1 or 2 to start collapsed. Add `\"collapsed\": true` to a node to close just that branch.","For large trees add `\"roam\": true` so the user can pan and zoom."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{"trigger":"item","triggerOn":"mousemove"},"series":[{"type":"tree","data":[{"name":"Plant","children":[{"name":"Utilities","children":[{"name":"Boiler House","children":[{"name":"Boiler 1"},{"name":"Boiler 2"}]},{"name":"Compressed Air","children":[{"name":"Compressor A"},{"name":"Compressor B"},{"name":"Dryer"}]},{"name":"Chilled Water","children":[{"name":"Chiller 1"},{"name":"Chiller 2"}]}]},{"name":"Processing","children":[{"name":"Mixing","children":[{"name":"Mixer 1"},{"name":"Mixer 2"},{"name":"CIP Skid"}]},{"name":"Pasteurising","children":[{"name":"Pasteuriser"},{"name":"Homogeniser"},{"name":"Balance Tank"}]}]},{"name":"Packaging","children":[{"name":"Line 1","children":[{"name":"Filler 1"},{"name":"Capper 1"},{"name":"Labeller"}]},{"name":"Line 2","children":[{"name":"Filler 2"},{"name":"Capper 2"},{"name":"Case Packer"},{"name":"Palletiser"}]}]},{"name":"Warehouse","children":[{"name":"Cold Store"},{"name":"Dock 1"},{"name":"Dock 2"}]}]}],"top":10,"bottom":10,"left":50,"right":110,"symbolSize":8,"initialTreeDepth":-1,"label":{"position":"top","verticalAlign":"bottom","align":"right","distance":3,"fontSize":11},"leaves":{"label":{"position":"right","verticalAlign":"middle","align":"left","distance":5}},"emphasis":{"focus":"descendant"},"expandAndCollapse":true,"animationDuration":550,"animationDurationUpdate":750}]}}},
{"id":"bottom-to-top","label":"Bottom to Top Tree","description":"Root at the bottom growing upwards, with vertical labels.","howTo":["Bind `series[0].data` to a list holding one root object with nested `children`.","`orient` is `\"BT\"`; use `\"TB\"` for the root at the top (then change the leaf label to `position: \"bottom\"`, `align: \"right\"`).","Labels are rotated 90°: branch names run alongside their incoming edge (`series[0].label`), leaf names stand above the leaves (`series[0].leaves.label`). `top` must fit the longest leaf name."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{"trigger":"item","triggerOn":"mousemove"},"series":[{"type":"tree","data":[{"name":"Plant","children":[{"name":"Utilities","children":[{"name":"Boiler House","children":[{"name":"Boiler 1"},{"name":"Boiler 2"}]},{"name":"Compressed Air","children":[{"name":"Compressor A"},{"name":"Compressor B"},{"name":"Dryer"}]},{"name":"Chilled Water","children":[{"name":"Chiller 1"},{"name":"Chiller 2"}]}]},{"name":"Processing","children":[{"name":"Mixing","children":[{"name":"Mixer 1"},{"name":"Mixer 2"},{"name":"CIP Skid"}]},{"name":"Pasteurising","children":[{"name":"Pasteuriser"},{"name":"Homogeniser"},{"name":"Balance Tank"}]}]},{"name":"Packaging","children":[{"name":"Line 1","children":[{"name":"Filler 1"},{"name":"Capper 1"},{"name":"Labeller"}]},{"name":"Line 2","children":[{"name":"Filler 2"},{"name":"Capper 2"},{"name":"Case Packer"},{"name":"Palletiser"}]}]},{"name":"Warehouse","children":[{"name":"Cold Store"},{"name":"Dock 1"},{"name":"Dock 2"}]}]}],"orient":"BT","left":16,"right":16,"top":90,"bottom":50,"symbolSize":8,"initialTreeDepth":-1,"label":{"position":"left","rotate":90,"verticalAlign":"bottom","align":"right","distance":4,"fontSize":11},"leaves":{"label":{"position":"top","rotate":90,"verticalAlign":"middle","align":"left"}},"emphasis":{"focus":"descendant"},"expandAndCollapse":true,"animationDurationUpdate":750}]}}},
{"id":"radial","label":"Radial Tree","description":"Root in the centre with levels on concentric circles and labels following the spokes.","howTo":["Bind `series[0].data` to a list holding one root object with nested `children`.","Labels follow the spokes automatically. Near the centre that gets crowded, so here the root label is hidden (`label.show: false` on the root) and every branch node carries `label: {rotate: 0, position: \"top\"}` to stay horizontal (leaves keep the automatic rotation). If you bind the whole data, add those `label` objects in your transform.","The four margins (`top`, `bottom`, `left`, `right`) must fit the longest leaf label, which is drawn outside the outer circle."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{"trigger":"item","triggerOn":"mousemove"},"series":[{"type":"tree","data":[{"name":"Plant","children":[{"name":"Utilities","children":[{"name":"Boiler House","children":[{"name":"Boiler 1"},{"name":"Boiler 2"}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":3}},{"name":"Compressed Air","children":[{"name":"Compressor A"},{"name":"Compressor B"},{"name":"Dryer"}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":3}},{"name":"Chilled Water","children":[{"name":"Chiller 1"},{"name":"Chiller 2"}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":3}}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":4,"fontWeight":"bold"}},{"name":"Processing","children":[{"name":"Mixing","children":[{"name":"Mixer 1"},{"name":"Mixer 2"},{"name":"CIP Skid"}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":3}},{"name":"Pasteurising","children":[{"name":"Pasteuriser"},{"name":"Homogeniser"},{"name":"Balance Tank"}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":3}}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":4,"fontWeight":"bold"}},{"name":"Packaging","children":[{"name":"Line 1","children":[{"name":"Filler 1"},{"name":"Capper 1"},{"name":"Labeller"}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":3}},{"name":"Line 2","children":[{"name":"Filler 2"},{"name":"Capper 2"},{"name":"Case Packer"},{"name":"Palletiser"}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":3}}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":4,"fontWeight":"bold"}},{"name":"Warehouse","children":[{"name":"Cold Store"},{"name":"Dock 1"},{"name":"Dock 2"}],"label":{"rotate":0,"position":"top","distance":4,"fontWeight":"bold"}}],"label":{"show":false}}],"layout":"radial","top":70,"bottom":70,"left":70,"right":70,"symbol":"emptyCircle","symbolSize":7,"initialTreeDepth":-1,"label":{"fontSize":10},"emphasis":{"focus":"descendant"},"animationDurationUpdate":750}]}}},
{"id":"polyline","label":"Polyline Tree","description":"Orthogonal (elbow) edges instead of curves, as in a classic hierarchy diagram.","howTo":["Bind `series[0].data` to a list holding one root object with nested `children`.","`edgeShape: \"polyline\"` draws the elbows; `edgeForkPosition` is where the line forks between parent and child (0 % = at the parent, 100 % = at the child)."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{"trigger":"item","triggerOn":"mousemove"},"series":[{"type":"tree","data":[{"name":"Plant","children":[{"name":"Utilities","children":[{"name":"Boiler House","children":[{"name":"Boiler 1"},{"name":"Boiler 2"}]},{"name":"Compressed Air","children":[{"name":"Compressor A"},{"name":"Compressor B"},{"name":"Dryer"}]},{"name":"Chilled Water","children":[{"name":"Chiller 1"},{"name":"Chiller 2"}]}]},{"name":"Processing","children":[{"name":"Mixing","children":[{"name":"Mixer 1"},{"name":"Mixer 2"},{"name":"CIP Skid"}]},{"name":"Pasteurising","children":[{"name":"Pasteuriser"},{"name":"Homogeniser"},{"name":"Balance Tank"}]}]},{"name":"Packaging","children":[{"name":"Line 1","children":[{"name":"Filler 1"},{"name":"Capper 1"},{"name":"Labeller"}]},{"name":"Line 2","children":[{"name":"Filler 2"},{"name":"Capper 2"},{"name":"Case Packer"},{"name":"Palletiser"}]}]},{"name":"Warehouse","children":[{"name":"Cold Store"},{"name":"Dock 1"},{"name":"Dock 2"}]}]}],"top":10,"bottom":10,"left":50,"right":110,"symbolSize":7,"edgeShape":"polyline","edgeForkPosition":"63%","initialTreeDepth":-1,"lineStyle":{"width":2},"label":{"position":"top","verticalAlign":"bottom","align":"right","distance":3,"fontSize":11},"leaves":{"label":{"position":"right","verticalAlign":"middle","align":"left","distance":5}},"emphasis":{"focus":"descendant"},"expandAndCollapse":true,"animationDurationUpdate":750}]}}},
{"id":"org-chart","label":"Org Chart Tree","description":"Top-down boxes with the label inside each node and elbow connectors.","howTo":["Bind `series[0].data` to a list holding one root object with nested `children`. Keep names short: every node is a box of `symbolSize` `[width, height]` pixels with the name inside.","Sibling boxes are spaced evenly across the width, so the widest level decides how wide a box can be. With more than about seven boxes on one level, shrink `symbolSize` or enable panning (`roam` is already on).","Colour one box with `itemStyle.color` on that node, for example to show a state."],"props":{"option":{"series":[{"type":"tree","orient":"TB","top":50,"bottom":50,"left":40,"right":40,"symbol":"roundRect","symbolSize":[54,26],"edgeShape":"polyline","edgeForkPosition":"50%","initialTreeDepth":-1,"roam":true,"itemStyle":{"color":"#3d85c6","borderWidth":0},"lineStyle":{"width":2},"label":{"position":"inside","color":"#fff","fontSize":10},"expandAndCollapse":false,"data":[{"name":"Plant","children":[{"name":"Process","children":[{"name":"Mixing"},{"name":"Thermal"}]},{"name":"Packing","children":[{"name":"Line 1"},{"name":"Line 2"}]},{"name":"Utilities","children":[{"name":"Steam"},{"name":"Air"}]}]}]}]}}},
{"id":"multiple","label":"Multiple Trees","description":"Two tree series side by side, switched on and off through the legend.","howTo":["Each tree is its own series with its own `data` (one root object each) and its own rectangle (`left` / `right` / `top` / `bottom`).","The legend entries must match the series `name`s; clicking one hides that tree.","Series colours are set explicitly (`itemStyle` and `lineStyle.color`) because tree series do not pick distinct theme colours on their own."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{"trigger":"item","triggerOn":"mousemove"},"legend":{"top":6,"left":"center","data":[{"name":"North Plant","icon":"rect"},{"name":"South Plant","icon":"rect"}]},"series":[{"type":"tree","name":"North Plant","itemStyle":{"color":"#3d85c6","borderColor":"#3d85c6"},"lineStyle":{"color":"rgba(61,133,198,0.45)"},"top":40,"bottom":10,"left":40,"right":"62%","symbolSize":7,"label":{"position":"top","verticalAlign":"bottom","align":"right","distance":3,"fontSize":11},"leaves":{"label":{"position":"right","verticalAlign":"middle","align":"left","distance":5}},"emphasis":{"focus":"descendant"},"initialTreeDepth":-1,"data":[{"name":"North","children":[{"name":"Mixing","children":[{"name":"Mixer 1"},{"name":"Mixer 2"},{"name":"CIP Skid"}]},{"name":"Thermal","children":[{"name":"Pasteuriser"},{"name":"Homogeniser"}]},{"name":"Line 1","children":[{"name":"Filler"},{"name":"Capper"},{"name":"Labeller"}]},{"name":"Utilities","children":[{"name":"Boiler"},{"name":"Chiller"},{"name":"Compressor"}]}]}]},{"type":"tree","name":"South Plant","itemStyle":{"color":"#e69138","borderColor":"#e69138"},"lineStyle":{"color":"rgba(230,145,56,0.45)"},"top":70,"bottom":40,"left":"58%","right":80,"symbolSize":7,"label":{"position":"top","verticalAlign":"bottom","align":"right","distance":3,"fontSize":11},"leaves":{"label":{"position":"right","verticalAlign":"middle","align":"left","distance":5}},"emphasis":{"focus":"descendant"},"initialTreeDepth":-1,"data":[{"name":"South","children":[{"name":"Line 2","children":[{"name":"Filler"},{"name":"Capper"},{"name":"Case Packer"},{"name":"Palletiser"}]},{"name":"Warehouse","children":[{"name":"Cold Store"},{"name":"Dock 1"},{"name":"Dock 2"}]},{"name":"Utilities","children":[{"name":"Boiler"},{"name":"Chiller"}]}]}]}]}}}
